  "normalizedContent": {
    "text": "Corporate Tax Corporate Tax Topics Small Business Relief Exempt Person: Failure to meet conditions Exempt Person Basis of Taxation Non-Residents Basis of Taxation - Natural Person Permanent Establishment Effectively managed and controlled in UAE Resident Juridical Person Corporate Tax Webinars Corporate Tax Workshops FAQs Guides, References & Public Clarifications E-learning Basis of Taxation - Natural Person A Natural Person is subject to Corporate Tax only if: They Conduct Business or Business Activity in the UAE; and Total Turnover derived from Business or Business Activities exceeds AED 1 million within the calendar year (Jan to Dec) Sources generating the following income streams are not considered as Business or Business Activities: Wages Personal Investment Income Real Estate Investment Income Natural Persons should not register if: they do not conduct a Business or Business Activity in the UAE; or conduct a Business or Business Activity generating a turnover not exceeding AED 1 million",
